mmer-beach","https://www.waterlandvanfriesland.nl/en/lemmer","https://www.visitingthedutchcountryside.com/friesland/things-to-do-lemmer-friesland-netherlands/"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Walk around the Dock","type":"activity","detail":"The streets ringing the old harbour in the middle of town. The channel through Lemmer is the busy link between the Frisian lakes and the IJsselmeer, so the two bridges open and shut all day and the whole town watches the boats go through.","evidence":{"n_sources":5,"of":11,"urls":["https://www.waterlandvanfriesland.nl/en/lemmer","https://www.visitingthedutchcountryside.com/friesland/things-to-do-lemmer-friesland-netherlands/","https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attractions-g1045111-Activities-Lemmer_Friesland_Province.html"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Cycle into Gaasterland","type":"activity","detail":"South west of town the flat gives way to woods, low cliffs and lake shore. A bicycle ferry over the Rijnsloot gets you across, and the routes run on to Balk and Woudsend.","season":[4,5,6,7,8,9,10],"evidence":{"n_sources":5,"of":11,"urls":["https://www.friesland.nl/nl/routes/3755413076/fietsroute-zuidwest-friesland","https://www.waterlandvanfriesland.nl/nl/routes/91014931/rondje-woudsend-lemmer-en-balk","https://www.hartvanlemmer.nl/nieuws/fietsroutes-verhuur-en-oplaadpunten-e-bikes-in-lemmer/"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Out on the LE50","type":"experience","detail":"A Lemster fishing boat that worked until 1974 takes passengers onto the IJsselmeer on Friday afternoons from April to the middle of October.","season":[4,5,6,7,8,9,10],"evidence":{"n_sources":3,"of":11,"urls":["https://www.waterlandvanfriesland.nl/en/lemmer","https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attractions-g1045111-Activities-Lemmer_Friesland_Province.html","https://www.visitingthedutchcountryside.com/friesland/things-to-do-lemmer-friesland-netherlands/"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"WNW WaterReijk -Kuinre - rode route",